---
title: Bread Machine Shokupan
image: https://img-global.cpcdn.com/recipes/48bbae3132989400/1200x630cq80/photo.jpg
course: Breakfast
time required: 3 hours
author: Yuki
source: https://cookpad.com/eng/recipes/830120
servings: 15
---

Place all ingredients in order suggested by your bread machine's manufacturer: @whole milk{150%g}(room temperature), @water{100%g}, @bread flour{400%g}, @butter{30%g}(melted), @sugar{3%tbsp}, @salt{1.5%tsp}, @dry yeast{1.5%tsp}.

Bake on White Bread setting. 

Cool on wire rack before slicing.